{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19101090","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19101090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910109001:1":{"text":"……人类，你从刚刚那艘商船下来的？你来卡什澜做什么？","source_cn":"……人类，你从刚刚那艘商船下来的？你来卡什澜做什么？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xA58A64DCB596EABE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1910109001":{"text":"……人类，你从刚刚那艘商船下来的？你来卡什澜做什么？","source_cn":"……人类，你从刚刚那艘商船下来的？你来卡什澜做什么？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xA58A64DCB596EABE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910109002:1":{"text":"是吗，来卡什澜旅游？","source_cn":"是吗，来卡什澜旅游？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x5E478F9A6B8B21CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910109003:1":{"text":"那你恐怕选错了时机。最近潮汐变得很不规律，现在的卡什澜...","source_cn":"那你恐怕选错了时机。最近潮汐变得很不规律，现在的卡什澜...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910109007:1":{"text":"人类，对海必须保持基本的敬畏。它比你想得更强大，也更难懂。","source_cn":"人类，对海必须保持基本的敬畏。它比你想得更强大，也更难懂。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x94C3A62A7C69F2DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910109008:1":{"text":"我们出生就一直生活在这里。但即使是我们，也不敢号称自己...","source_cn":"我们出生就一直生活在这里。但即使是我们，也不敢号称自己...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1910109008":{"text":"我们出生就一直生活在这里。但即使是我们，也不敢号称自己对流光海了若指掌。","source_cn":"我们出生就一直生活在这里。但即使是我们，也不敢号称自己对流光海了若指掌。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xDFA66FC297E16E40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910109009:1":{"text":"不知道。即便是卡什澜最出色的渔猎者也找不到原因。","source_cn":"不知道。即便是卡什澜最出色的渔猎者也找不到原因。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x3DA7EC0E57DBC20C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910109010:1":{"text":"我们虽不臣服于海潮，但我们终究无法控制潮汐，只能眼睁睁...","source_cn":"我们虽不臣服于海潮，但我们终究无法控制潮汐，只能眼睁睁...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910109011:1":{"text":"看看海岸线，这个点竟然就退潮了。如果按平常经验出海，木...","source_cn":"看看海岸线，这个点竟然就退潮了。如果按平常经验出海，木...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910109012:1":{"text":"大海啊……你究竟想做什么？恐怕只有<style=hig...","source_cn":"大海啊……你究竟想做什么？恐怕只有<style=hig...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1910109012":{"text":"大海啊……你究竟想做什么？恐怕只有<style=highlight>波涛长者</style>才知道了……","source_cn":"大海啊……你究竟想做什么？恐怕只有<style=highlight>波涛长者</style>才知道了……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x8CB3B61D040AC3A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910109013:1":{"text":"看来你的确对卡什澜一无所知。","source_cn":"看来你的确对卡什澜一无所知。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x790EE5F4A08589D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910109014:1":{"text":"那是一头生活在流光海中的海兽，是卡什澜的信仰，是你能想...","source_cn":"那是一头生活在流光海中的海兽，是卡什澜的信仰，是你能想...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910109015:1":{"text":"出海前祈愿，回程时放归一只猎物，它就会保佑我们出航平安。","source_cn":"出海前祈愿，回程时放归一只猎物，它就会保佑我们出航平安。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x1E043D2CBCDAFF87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910109016:1":{"tex